cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the EBImage package when reporting analyses produced with this workflow."
title: "IHC Quantification Skill"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "IHC Quantification Skill contributors"
version: 2.2.2
date-released: 2026-08-05
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible and auditable R/EBImage workflow for DAB/hematoxylin
  brightfield IHC quantification with global-first analysis, reviewed ROI
  support, H-DAB quality control, four explicit measurement domains, and
  biological-unit-level comparison figures.
keywords:
  - immunohistochemistry
  - DAB
  - image analysis
  - EBImage
  - H-score
  - reproducible research
